third parties and original themes inspired by other products. Unless identified
as original work below, conversion to the RStudio theme format does not replace
or supersede the copyright or license of the upstream work. Each converted
theme remains subject to the corresponding upstream license listed below. Full
license texts and additional source information are provided under licenses/.

The converted files were generated or modified for rstudiothemes in 2026.

